<p>I am fond of this panel. I have years of experience with outliners, which means that my fingers have memory. <strong>Traverse</strong> gives me the ability to customize all of the keyboard commands to suit my muscle memory. This makes it easier to adopt a new application in this category.</p>
<p><img src="https://cdn.blot.im/blog_c4a729f3205a44e5a9669523ddfb8b2e/_image_cache/442a142e-1f3d-4e08-8b38-8ebd3ab8a236/traverse-percent2004.png" alt="traverse new outlines" width="1652" height="1548" data-action="zoom"><span class="caption">traverse new outlines</span></p>
<p>You can set some options for new outlines you create. I like Writer view. There are some other properties you can set.</p>
<p><img src="https://cdn.blot.im/blog_c4a729f3205a44e5a9669523ddfb8b2e/_image_cache/3f9f998b-ef08-47b7-bd3a-a2bfe68a33b7/traverse-percent2005.png" alt="traverse ai" width="1652" height="1548" data-action="zoom"><span class="caption">traverse ai</span></p>
